WEBVTT

00:00:06.084 --> 00:00:07.520
There's another.

00:00:07.564 --> 00:00:12.090
It's not happy, exactly.

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:14.092
Well, it is.

00:00:14.135 --> 00:00:17.443
It's the happiest
I've ever felt...

00:00:17.486 --> 00:00:19.619
but it's complicated.

00:00:19.663 --> 00:00:21.795
Is it strong?

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.628
Then let's give it a try.

00:00:28.672 --> 00:00:30.151
You feel ready?

00:00:31.588 --> 00:00:34.460
Just do it.

00:00:36.549 --> 00:00:39.465
[ shrieking]

00:00:43.034 --> 00:00:45.558
Expecto Patronum!

00:00:47.255 --> 00:00:50.824
Expecto Patronum!

00:00:50.868 --> 00:00:53.348
[ grunts]

00:01:02.444 --> 00:01:08.537
♪

00:01:09.582 --> 00:01:11.845
[ laughs]

00:01:11.889 --> 00:01:14.282
Yes!

00:01:14.326 --> 00:01:15.457
[ grunting]

00:01:15.501 --> 00:01:18.678
Well done, Harry.
Well done!

00:01:18.722 --> 00:01:22.290
I think I've had
enough... for today.

00:01:22.334 --> 00:01:25.424
Yes. Sit down.
Here, eat this, it helps.

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:27.208
It really helps.

00:01:27.252 --> 00:01:28.645
And just so you know, Harry,

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:30.472
I think you would
have given your father

00:01:30.516 --> 00:01:31.996
a run for his money.

00:01:32.039 --> 00:01:34.389
And that is saying something.

00:01:34.433 --> 00:01:36.304
[ sighing]

00:01:36.348 --> 00:01:40.178
I was thinking
of him... and Mum.

00:01:40.221 --> 00:01:43.355
Seeing their faces.

00:01:43.398 --> 00:01:46.488
They were talking to me.

00:01:46.532 --> 00:01:48.665
Just talking.

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:51.842
That's the memory
I chose.

00:01:51.885 --> 00:01:56.107
I don't even know
if it's real,

00:01:56.150 --> 00:01:59.719
but it's the best I have.

00:02:07.553 --> 00:02:09.686
HERMIONE:
Beautiful day.

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:11.252
Gorgeous.

00:02:11.296 --> 00:02:12.732
Unless, of course, you've
been ripped to pieces.

00:02:12.776 --> 00:02:13.733
Ripped to pieces?

00:02:13.777 --> 00:02:15.213
What are you
talking about?

00:02:15.256 --> 00:02:17.171
Ronald has lost his rat.

00:02:17.215 --> 00:02:18.999
I haven't
lost anything.

00:02:19.043 --> 00:02:20.522
Your cat killed him.

00:02:20.566 --> 00:02:22.133
Rubbish.

00:02:22.176 --> 00:02:23.700
Harry, you've seen the way
that bloodthirsty beast

00:02:23.743 --> 00:02:25.745
of hers is always
lurking about.

00:02:25.789 --> 00:02:27.573
And Scabbers is gone.

00:02:27.616 --> 00:02:28.922
Well, maybe
you should learn

00:02:28.966 --> 00:02:31.185
to take better
care of your pets!

00:02:31.229 --> 00:02:33.274
Your cat killed him!

00:02:33.318 --> 00:02:34.058
Did not.

00:02:34.101 --> 00:02:35.320
Did.Didn't.

00:02:35.363 --> 00:02:38.410
HERMIONE:
How did it go, Hagrid?

00:02:38.453 --> 00:02:40.281
The hearing?

00:02:40.325 --> 00:02:41.761
Well, first off,

00:02:41.805 --> 00:02:43.197
the committee members
took turns

00:02:43.241 --> 00:02:46.679
talking about
why we were there.

00:02:47.114 --> 00:02:49.813
And then I got up
and did my piece,

00:02:49.856 --> 00:02:52.293
said how Buckbeak
was a good hippogriff,

00:02:52.337 --> 00:02:53.904
always cleaned his feathers.

00:02:53.947 --> 00:02:56.645
And then,
Lucius Malfoy got up.

00:02:56.689 --> 00:02:58.299
Well, you can imagine.

00:02:58.343 --> 00:03:00.432
He said Buckbeak was a deadly
and dangerous creature

00:03:00.475 --> 00:03:04.131
who would kill you
as soon as look at you.

00:03:04.175 --> 00:03:05.742
HERMIONE:
And then?

00:03:05.785 --> 00:03:09.006
And then he asked for
the worst, did ol' Lucius.

00:03:09.049 --> 00:03:11.095
RON:
They're not sacking you.

00:03:11.138 --> 00:03:14.359
No, I'm not sacked.

00:03:14.402 --> 00:03:19.451
Buckbeak's
been sentenced to death.

00:03:19.494 --> 00:03:21.627
[ splashing]

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:24.543
[ sobbing]

